    "detailed_description": "The &quot;<strong>AB Button Puzzle Game</strong>&quot; is too simple to be not lost!<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107840/extras/3ec9d125da9299a5c8488b1644e34c24.poster.avif?t=1723037484\" width=638 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107840/extras/3ec9d125da9299a5c8488b1644e34c24.webm?t=1723037484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107840/extras/3ec9d125da9299a5c8488b1644e34c24.mp4?t=1723037484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br>Hmm?<br><br><br><br><br>The familiar &quot;<strong>AB button</strong>&quot; is in motion\ud83d\ude00<br><br><i>Press Hold Drag&amp;Drop</i> etc...<br>Let's see what you can do\ud83d\ude1d<br><br><br><br><br>Oh, before I forget, please use <strong>AB</strong> of your keyboard\ud83d\ude04<br><br>\u25a0Overview<br>This is a puzzle game that can be played using the mouse and keyboard, and is too simple to be not lost.<br>There is nothing difficult.<br><br>\u25a0How to play<br>Click or hold down the AB button.<br>AB button should have some movement.<br>If you fill AB to the clear condition, you will clear the game.<br><br>\u25a0Suitable for play the game<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Want to play in a very short time, or want to play for a little while in a gap.<br></li><li>Those who want to play by clicking buttons rather than puzzles.<br></li><li>Not good at complicated puzzles.</li></ul><br>\u25a0NOTES<br>There is no save function in this game.<br>You cannot use a gamepad.<br><br>\u25a0Others<br>This game has no text, but English is used only for credits.",
